{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the action and feel the atmosphere of ZEROAD. This demo delivers a complete gameplay loop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The current demo version includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 weapon class (pistols, shotguns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different weapon models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 weapon upgrades that can be installed at the base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 weapon enhancements that can be found on the &quot;Roads&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 &quot;Roads&quot; to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 types of zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Max Level: 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Shooting Skill Level: 2</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This content offers about 30 minutes of gameplay \u2014 enough to get a solid feel for the game and see if ZEROAD is for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084190?t=1760995553","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084190?t=1760995553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084190/7c18e5fdcfcf95911027d283cbadf124be8fb28d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760995553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084190/7c18e5fdcfcf95911027d283cbadf124be8fb28d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760995553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_desc